Package: FINNmodelBWI
Type: Package
Title: A Fitted FINN Forest Model for German Forests (BWI)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Yannek", family = "Käber", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "y.kaeber@posteo.de", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7041-9849")),
      person(given = "Maximilian", family = "Pichler", role = "aut",
             email = "maximilian.pichler@biologie.uni-regensburg.de", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2252-8327")))
Description: A fitted FINN forest model calibrated to the German National Forest
    Inventory (Bundeswaldinventur, BWI; 2002, 2012 and 2022 surveys), packaged as a
    versioned simulation tool. Loads the released parameters, rebuilds the model
    with the installed FINN and simulates annual forest dynamics of 15 tree species
    for new sites, with the management intensity (regular-harvest tier) and a
    soil-moisture drought index as user-settable covariates.
